    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d41-a1">

                <pb facs="0180" n="810" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg810"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Commander <persName type="from">Kennedy</persName> to
                        Mr. <persName corresp="#p_TB1" type="to">Biddle</persName></hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#right">H. M. S. REINDEER.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I have just come up here to see if I
                    can be of any use to you or any one. Pray let me know if such is the case. I
                    will take you and your family to Panama if you like.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName>W. R. KENNEDY</persName>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Commander, Royal Navy.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
